Allows shields to be equipped, using Cunning instead of strength as a requirement.

When you are attacked in melee, you have a [18%, 20%, 21%, 23%, 24% (TL1-5; CUN 100)] chance to deflect the attack with your shield, completely evading it.

In addition, as long as you are wearing armour no heavier than leather, you gain [0, 6, 9, 11, 13 (TL1-5)] Armour and [7%, 14%, 18%, 21%, 23% (TL1-5)] Armour hardiness.

The chance to deflect increases with your Cunning.
